From e58f41c99552710f1c5d9f757fa0ce458a63f11f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Zhestkov <vzhestkov@suse.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 09:20:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Remove rpm-vercmp dependency and fix pkg.version_cmp

* Fix rpm pkg warnings and remove fallback to slow process fork

* Avoid ignoring the release as it is harming the behaviour

* Fix the rpm version comparison test

* Add few more test cases

* Drop rpm-vercmp from requirements

---------

Co-authored-by: bdrx312 <bdrx312@users.noreply.github.com>
